WEBVTT

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.850
Ja-sheen!

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.070
<i>The Great Jahy was on a roll.</i>

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.750
<i>Earlier, she acquired a large 
mana crystal with surprising ease.</i>

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:29.230
<i>And now, she's enjoying a 
vacation at a luxury beach resort.</i>

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.060
I haven't cut loose like this in a while!

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:45.920
At this rate, restoring the Dark Realm
 will be a piece of cake!

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:48.400
Hy-chan!

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:54.530
Stop playing around and come help.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:59.030
<b>Beach Shack Maou.</b>

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.440
That's right.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.750
Stop slacking off!

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:09.400
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.530
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:11.740
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:12.910
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.080
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.330
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:34.500
<b>Restoration Plan No. 13

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.790
We didn't come here to have fun, you know.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:37.120
We're here to help my uncle
 with his beach shack.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.760
Hy-chan, please do your best.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:43.580
Every year I get swamped on the weekends,

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.720
so I'd be grateful if you could help me out.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:52.690
<b>Shaved Ice</b>

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:52.690
<b>Ice</b>

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:52.690
<b>Yakisoba</b>

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:52.690
<b>Yakisoba</b>

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:52.690
<b>Draft
Beer</b>

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:48.430
Stop goofing off and get to work.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:52.690
Why the hell do I have 
to work at a dump like this?

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:55.080
Look at this massive mana crystal!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.200
<i>This</i> is how powerful I am!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.720
Fine, then no lunch for you.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.330
My uncle's yakisoba is famous, you know.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:07.070
The line-up for it gets really long.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.300
I'll take care of your meals.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:15.290
You can have whatever you like.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.510
Well, I guess I could lend a hand...

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:25.720
Then could you pack this up 
into these boxes, Li'l Jaby?

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:29.440
I am not "Li'l Jaby"! 
That's the Great Jahy to you!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.560
Uncle?!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.360
My... lower back...

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.490
<b>Beach Shack Maou.</b>

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:43.190
It's been a while since
my lower back's gone out.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:46.180
And right during the busiest time...

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.210
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:52.780
We'll take care of the shack, 
so just relax and get some rest.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:04:04.260
<b>Ice</b>

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.220
Great deal on yakisoba!

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.920
It's really tasty!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.790
This is so strange...

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:04.260
Maybe it's not the same without Uncle.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:09.220
<b>Shaved Ice</b>

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:09.220
I mean... but how come no one's out here?

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.220
<i>This is lifeguard services.</i>

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:15.940
<i>A large number of jellyfish have 
been spotted off the coast.</i>

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.490
<i>Please avoid getting in the water.</i>

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.280
Oh, jellyfish?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.400
If they're the stinging type, that's bad.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.290
There's sure a lot of them this year.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.620
Oh, this won't do. 
You're supposed to be resting.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:32.710
We had nonstop rain before this,
so business was dead.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:37.350
I was happy we finally got some 
sunny weather, and now there's jellyfish.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.360
My business is doomed.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.170
Oh, my...

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.580
You really can't catch a break.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:49.540
<i>There's no doubt about it! There's got
 to be another crystal around here!</i>

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:54.310
<i>That mana crystal needs me, 
so it caused misfortune to summon me here!</i>

00:04:54.510 --> 00:05:00.270
<i>And if it's generating this much trouble,
it must be an extremely powerful one!</i>

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:04.280
Knowing that, how could I just stand around
and work this crummy job?

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.360
Hey, wait!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.420
They just said to stay out of the water!

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:12.910
Get back to work, Ja-ko!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:19.080
Fine, no ice cream for dessert for you.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:29.660
And here you are.
One draft beer and one yakisoba.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.220
I'm just here for lunch, though.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.180
Yeah, nope.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.190
We came all the way here, 
and there's jellyfish.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.700
How disappointing.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:39.520
Yeah.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.000
Daddy, I want to go swimming!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.700
I'm sorry. Let's be patient, okay?

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:47.240
No! I wanna swim!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.550
<i>Indeed. Looks like the 
misfortune just keeps coming.</i>

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:53.030
<i>I knew it! I need to get going!</i>

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.350
<i>I must find it quickly!</i>

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:55.700
This again?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.540
No pay for you!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.180
Work, work, you say, but we've 
barely got any customers.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.020
You're right.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:17.270
It's usually a full house here, 
but there's still plenty for us to do.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.630
Here. Take these out.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.160
You liar!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.190
I didn't think you were that kind of guy!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:26.400
Shut up! Just drop it already.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.890
I'm leaving you!

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.150
Goodbye!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.480
Wait just a minute!

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:31.870
Stop following me!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:36.590
<i>That's... got to be one giant mana crystal!</i>

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.080
No, I'm doing this!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.540
I don't need ice cream!
 I don't need any pay!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.000
This <i>again</i>?

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.750
I'm going to find that mana stone!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.530
Oh no, rain.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:53.430
The forecast said it would be sunny all day.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.450
We came all the way here for this?

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:56.890
We're so unlucky!

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.680
<i>I knew it! Fortune's on my side.</i>

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.040
<i>The mana crystal is causing one 
catastrophe after another,</i>

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.110
<i>and that powerful baby's going to be mine!</i>

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:07.320
Hy-chan?

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.560
Where are you, mana crystal?!

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:14.040
Going by the concentration of bad luck,

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.460
the mana crystal should be 
somewhere close to here.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.120
Help me!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.900
Daddy, I'm scared!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.930
I'm calling the lifeguard right now!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.920
It's got to be over there near that kid!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.370
Help me!

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:34.760
You're in the way, kid.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.350
I'm looking for that mana crystal!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.780
Be good and stay there!

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.490
Thank you so much!

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:47.930
Thank you...

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.250
Now nobody will get in my way.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:56.240
I-I got stung by jellyfish 
and I'm so numb I can't swim!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.080
I-I'll be right there!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:07:59.500
Out of the way!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.440
Thank you so much.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.960
You saved her life.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.500
How can I ever thank her?

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:07.350
Don't think I did it for you!
 I'm in this for the mana crystal!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.740
Help me! A shark!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:17.020
Our boat is sinking!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.050
I'm caught in a whirlpool!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.980
Why won't this end?!

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:25.710
Help me!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.050
Someone!

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:29.900
My leg!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.150
Someone!

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.900
<i>Bad things keep happening,</i>

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:38.000
<i>yet I can't find a trace 
of that mana crystal...</i>

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.360
<i>What is this?</i>

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.160
<i>I didn't come here to save people!</i>

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.330
Hy-chan, why don't you call it a day?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.290
It's dangerous once it gets dark.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.760
I'll bring you again next time.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.760
Don't you want some ice cream?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:59.640
No! I'm not coming back until 
I find my mana crystal!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.720
I'll have my ice cream later!

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:06.190
Really? She's putting off ice cream?

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:09.540
<i>I'm on a roll right now!</i>

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:13.650
<i>I'm primed to bag a massive mana crystal!</i>

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.460
Hy-chan!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.790
Look at your feet!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.260
These are...

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:35.920
Mana crystals!

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:39.640
It's a ton of mana crystal shards!

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.560
Boss! Please get me a bucket!

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:50.380
Okay!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:57.150
Wow! Are these all mana crystals?

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:00.450
I did it!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.410
I knew I was on a roll!

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.870
<i>Ah, how many times have
 I been on the verge of giving up?</i>

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.870
<i>The Dark Realm was destroyed,</i>

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:12.180
<i>the lone mana crystal I worked 
so hard to get was stolen from me...</i>

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.540
<i>But with all these shards,</i>

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.660
<i>I can fight the magical girl!</i>

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:23.240
She's done for!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.750
Yo, Ja-ko, since you skipped out on work, 
it's coming out of your pay.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.440
You can't be that reckless, okay?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.990
They've been real worried
about you, Li'l Jaby.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.320
Take it easy rescuing folks, too.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:44.680
<i>That day, the Great Jahy saved many people</i>

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:47.000
<i>and retrieved the crystals 
causing their misfortunes.</i>

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:53.160
<i>Without even knowing it, 
she'd done a lot of philanthropic work.</i>

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.760
Profits are significantly up this quarter.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:03.720
The chairman would like to see you.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.040
All plans are on track.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.270
I understand.

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.480
Thank you for your report.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.290
Thank you.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.480
Thank you.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:22.630
<i>Lately, Druj has been haunted by sorrow.</i>

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:25.160
President, it's almost time to leave.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.220
The car is waiting for you.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.540
I'm coming.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:49.740
<i>I need to start planning my strategy for 
the final battle against the magical girl.</i>

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:53.410
<i>I've got some time until I have to go 
to work, and Kokoro is still at school.</i>

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.800
<i>This is the perf—</i>

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.360
O Great Jahy!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:00.800
How wonderful to run into you like this!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.030
What a perfect day!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.730
Oh, it's you, Druj.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.240
What do you want?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.040
Do forgive me.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:12.210
I happened to be on the road for work when 
I spotted you, and I couldn't stop myself!

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.360
<i>I'm in a good mood today.</i>

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:18.640
<i>Sometimes you gotta pander
 to the underlings.</i>

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.260
Working already, huh? That's commendable.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.920
<i>Is the Great Jahy p-p-praising me?</i>

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.780
I've got somewhere to be this evening myself.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.400
What's wrong, Druj?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:41.610
Here, this seat's open. Take it.

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:47.570
M-M-May I really sit next to you, Great Jahy?

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.040
<i>When we were back in the Dark Realm...</i>

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:56.750
Sit on same kind of chair as me? Outrageous!

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:00.460
You should be happy you're 
allowed to sit on ground!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:04.440
You're a waste of space.
At least make yourself a flowerpot.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.400
<i>That's what she said to me!</i>

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:11.250
Th-Then I'll just be taking this seat...

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:12.110
Sure.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:19.360
By the way, what are you doing here?

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:25.570
Things have been pretty hectic lately,
so I'm taking a breather.

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:27.280
A breather?

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:30.970
While developing my next plot, of course.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:34.000
You should try taking a breather sometimes too.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.500
It's not good to always keep pushing.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:39.240
You'll get exhausted if all you do is work.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:40.780
Yes...

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:49.890
Is the G-Great Jahy expressing
 concern for my well-being?

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.230
Back in the Dark Realm...

00:13:56.990 --> 00:13:59.840
I dug the hole, just like you told me to!

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.340
What should I do now?

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.610
Fill it back up.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:05.780
Excuse me?

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.320
Once you dig it, the next 
step is filling it back up.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.200
Fill it up.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.710
I want to know what it's like 
to keep doing useless work.

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:18.190
Your Greatness used to say, 
"You'll die from overwork? Then die!"

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:21.000
But now this, Your Greatness?!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.870
H-Huh?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.800
Did I really say that?

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.470
Well, you know, rest is important.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:32.010
You always work too much, Druj.

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.790
You're doing a good job.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.180
<i>She's blessed me with
so much encouragement...</i>

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:39.820
<i>So why?!</i>

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:42.650
<i>Why do I feel so unsatisfied?!</i>

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.980
<i>In the Dark Realm...</i>

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:48.050
Do it all over, you moron.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.950
Didn't you hear what I said?!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.190
It's all wrong!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:55.420
<i>She used to scold me because 
everything I did was wrong.</i>

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:59.230
<i>But ever since we were shunted here...</i>

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:07.160
Your Greatness, I believe you've changed 
since coming to the human realm.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:07.960
Huh?

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:15.050
<i>Did I say something wrong?</i>

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:19.670
<i>I've been spinning tale after tale 
to save face in front of Druj...</i>

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:22.270
<i>Did she finally figure me out?!</i>

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.790
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:28.860
<i>I never spent time outside relaxing
in the barren Dark Realm.</i>

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.740
Please enjoy yourself, O Great Jahy!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.680
What boring scenery.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.350
I've clearly been downgraded...

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.330
Your Greatness, in the past, you...

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:43.850
Wait, Druj!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.310
I want to clear things up 
since you seem to have the wrong idea.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:51.340
I'm only here because I don't want you 
to feel obligated to do anything extra.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:55.050
If it was an overly extravagant place, 
you wouldn't be able to relax, right?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.060
<i>What?</i>

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.050
<i>Was I wrong?</i>

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.920
<i>About what, though?</i>

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.520
<i>What is it?</i>

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:19.210
<i>Which one of my lies did she figure out?</i>

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.680
<i>That I'm completely broke?</i>

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:25.330
<i>That I'm only a waitress 
at the pub I don't actually own?</i>

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.540
<i>Or could it be...</i>

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:33.970
<i>Did she figure out that I haven't
 really defeated the magical girl?!</i>

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:40.390
Your Greatness, in the past, you...

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.820
In the past, I what?

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:45.150
In the past, you were more...

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:46.350
More what?

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:47.560
More...

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:48.810
More what?!

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:50.730
More!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.440
More?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.780
Wait, Druj!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.990
Things have happened—

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.450
You generously treated me more like a slave!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.600
Like a slave?

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.120
Things have happened?

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:16.380
What are you talking about?

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.850
Please forgive me, Great Jahy!

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:23.180
Yet still, I cannot forget the past!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:29.650
You generously used to treat me 
like trash. Like a dirty rag.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:32.580
Like a used, crumpled-up tissue.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:35.360
Like a rotten cucumber left in the fridge.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.260
Like the slimy grime in a drain!

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:41.790
And yet...

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.740
ever since coming to the human realm...

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.760
Maybe it's because 
you've taken human underlings,

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:51.170
but you've grown more and more kind.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.180
It's almost like you're becoming more human.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:00.550
I can't help but feel that way...

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:05.520
So please, Your Greatness, scold me!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.830
Treat me like livestock!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.230
Treat me like you did back in the Dark Realm!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.520
Gross.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.690
This! That's it!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:29.080
That cold, judgmental stare 
is the Great Jahy I love!

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.170
<i>Oh, that's right.</i>

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:42.190
<i>Since I've been seeing her do so well,
I'd completely forgotten...</i>

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:45.640
<i>This is what she's really like.</i>

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.730
Fill it back up!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.750
Yes! Right away!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.440
You moron.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.340
Didn't you hear what I said?

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.580
It's all wrong!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.750
<i>She laps up all my orders and abuse...</i>

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:11.540
<i>What an idiot.</i>

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.880
Thank you so much!

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:16.490
I see that you're still the Great Jahy I know.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:19.020
What a relief!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:24.660
Oh, right... Earlier, you mentioned 
that some things have happened.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:25.890
What did you mean by that?

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:29.160
That's none of your business.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:33.340
You think I'd tell you everything?

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:34.520
Know your place!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.650
I am deeply sorry!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.760
I shouldn't have asked.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:45.090
What's more, I've robbed you 
of your precious time.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:47.930
I think I should be going now.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:53.210
You couldn't be more wrong.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:57.420
Me, growing kind? Affected by the humans?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:58.750
Idiotic.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:00.880
That will never happen.

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:03.490
Don't worry, Druj.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:11.660
I am the Great Jahy, 
second-in-command of the Dark Realm.

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.970
I had the wrong impression...

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:19.480
Of course you would never change.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.390
You shall stay on top,
 even here in the human world!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.410
I shall continue to follow and serve you!

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.010
Druj...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.050
Great Jahy!

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.160
Hey, Kokoro! Is school over?

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.760
Yeah! Let's go look for mana crystals.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:47.760
Sure!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:53.270
<i>The Great Jahy narrowly managed
to keep Druj's respect for her.</i>

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:31.070
<b>Maou.</b>

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:32.960
<i>The time has come.</i>

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:34.590
Hy-chan...

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:37.240
I'm going.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:40.830
Did you pack bandages?

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.380
Tissues and your handkerchief?

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:44.620
I made some rice balls.
You should take them.

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:48.530
Don't you know where I'm going?!

00:22:48.530 --> 00:22:49.970
So you eat them on the spot?

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:52.930
You're going to see the magical girl, right?

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:56.140
I'm getting my mana crystal back.

00:22:57.800 --> 00:22:59.060
Good luck!

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:04.010
Don't worry.

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:06.340
I'm going to win for sure.

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:08.030
You got rice on your face.

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:14.650
<i>It's the Great Jahy against the magical girl!</i>

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:16.640
<i>The hour of the final battle draws near!</i>

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.960
<b>The Magical Girl Will Not Fight!</b>
